### Domain 4 — Monetization → `docs/monetization-strategy.md`

**Research before writing:**
- Pricing models of at least 3-4 comparable open-source security/infra
  companies, not just one or two — the more data points, the less any
  single company's quirks distort the recommendation.
- Whether there's any current signal on Warden's own traction (stars,
  installs, compatibility-matrix contributors) — if there isn't much yet,
  say so plainly rather than writing a monetization plan as if traction
  already exists.

**Produce, grounded in what you find:**
- `docs/monetization-strategy.md`: a tiering proposal with reasoning tied
  to the comparable companies you researched, not invented tier names
- An explicit sequencing section: what has to be true first (e.g., M8
  compatibility work done, some number of real self-hosted users) before
  any of this is worth building
- An explicit "don't build yet" list — since the project is pre-1.0, most
  of monetization should currently be documentation, not code

